<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux to sell 1 bln Ffr 12-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux to sell 1 bln Ffr 12-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French utility Generale des Eaux said on Friday it planned to issue on Monday a one billion franc bond with a maturity of 12 years and that French bank Societe Generale would be the lead manager.</p>
<p>&quot;We have a rare opportunity to issue (a bond) of this maturity,&quot; a Generale des Eaux spokesman said.</p>
<p>The terms of the issue will be set on Monday, he said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
